      "id": "11-mat-bab-05",
      "nomor": 5,
      "judul": "Penyelesaian Sistem Persamaan Linear dengan Matriks",
      "deskripsi": "Menggunakan matriks untuk menyelesaikan SPL",
      "estimasi_menit": 18,
      "konten": [
        {
          "tipe": "heading",
          "level": 2,
          "text": "SPL dalam Bentuk Matriks"
        },
        {
          "tipe": "paragraph",
          "text": "Sistem persamaan linear (SPL) bisa ditulis dalam bentuk matriks $AX = B$, dengan:"
        },
        {
          "tipe": "list",
          "ordered": false,
          "items": [
            "$A$ = matriks koefisien",
            "$X$ = matriks variabel (kolom)",
            "$B$ = matriks konstanta (kolom)"
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipe": "paragraph",
          "text": "Contoh SPL:"
        },
        {
          "tipe": "formula_block",
          "latex": "\\begin{cases} 2x + y = 7 \\\\ x + 3y = 11 \\end{cases}"
        },
        {
          "tipe": "paragraph",
          "text": "Bentuk matriksnya:"
        },
        {
          "tipe": "formula_block",
          "latex": "\\underbrace{\\begin{pmatrix} 2 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 3 \\end{pmatrix}}_{A} \\underbrace{\\begin{pmatrix} x \\\\ y \\end{pmatrix}}_{X} = \\underbrace{\\begin{pmatrix} 7 \\\\ 11 \\end{pmatrix}}_{B}"
        },
        {
          "tipe": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "Solusi dengan Invers"
        },
        {
          "tipe": "paragraph",
          "text": "Kalau $\\det(A) \\neq 0$, maka:"
        },
        {
          "tipe": "formula_block",
          "latex": "X = A^{-1} B"
        },
        {
          "tipe": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "Solusi dengan Aturan Cramer"
        },
        {
          "tipe": "paragraph",
          "text": "Metode lain yang populer, khususnya untuk SPL dengan 2 atau 3 variabel. Untuk SPL 2 variabel:"
        },
        {
          "tipe": "formula_block",
          "latex": "x = \\dfrac{D_x}{D}, \\quad y = \\dfrac{D_y}{D}"
        },
        {
          "tipe": "list",
          "ordered": false,
          "items": [
            "$D$ = determinan matriks koefisien",
            "$D_x$ = determinan dengan kolom $x$ diganti kolom konstanta",
            "$D_y$ = determinan dengan kolom $y$ diganti kolom konstanta"
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipe": "image",
          "src": "images/kelas11/matriks/aturan-cramer.png",
          "caption": "Ilustrasi aturan Cramer untuk SPL 2 variabel — $D$, $D_x$, dan $D_y$ dihitung dari determinan matriks yang berbeda",
          "width": "full"
        },
        {
          "tipe": "example",
          "judul": "Contoh 1: Aturan Cramer 2 Variabel",
          "konten": [
            { "tipe": "paragraph", "text": "Selesaikan $\\begin{cases} 2x + y = 7 \\\\ x + 3y = 11 \\end{cases}$ dengan aturan Cramer." },
            { "tipe": "paragraph", "text": "<b>Penyelesaian:</b>" },
            { "tipe": "formula_block", "latex": "D = \\begin{vmatrix} 2 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 3 \\end{vmatrix} = 6 - 1 = 5" },
            { "tipe": "formula_block", "latex": "D_x = \\begin{vmatrix} 7 & 1 \\\\ 11 & 3 \\end{vmatrix} = 21 - 11 = 10" },
            { "tipe": "formula_block", "latex": "D_y = \\begin{vmatrix} 2 & 7 \\\\ 1 & 11 \\end{vmatrix} = 22 - 7 = 15" },
            { "tipe": "formula_block", "latex": "x = \\dfrac{D_x}{D} = \\dfrac{10}{5} = 2, \\quad y = \\dfrac{D_y}{D} = \\dfrac{15}{5} = 3" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipe": "example",
          "judul": "Contoh 2: SPL 3 Variabel",
          "konten": [
            { "tipe": "paragraph", "text": "Selesaikan: $\\begin{cases} x + y + z = 6 \\\\ 2x - y + z = 3 \\\\ x + 2y - z = 2 \\end{cases}$" },
            { "tipe": "paragraph", "text": "<b>Penyelesaian:</b>" },
            { "tipe": "paragraph", "text": "Hitung $D$ dengan Sarrus:" },
            { "tipe": "formula_block", "latex": "D = \\begin{vmatrix} 1 & 1 & 1 \\\\ 2 & -1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 2 & -1 \\end{vmatrix}" },
            { "tipe": "formula_block", "latex": "= 1(1)(1) + 1(1)(1) + 1(2)(2) - 1(-1)(1) - 1(1)(2) - 1(2)(1)" },
            { "tipe": "formula_block", "latex": "= 1 + 1 + 4 + 1 - 2 - 2 = 3" },
            { "tipe": "paragraph", "text": "Hitung $D_x$, $D_y$, $D_z$ dengan cara serupa (ganti kolom yang sesuai)." },
            { "tipe": "formula_block", "latex": "D_x = \\begin{vmatrix} 6 & 1 & 1 \\\\ 3 & -1 & 1 \\\\ 2 & 2 & -1 \\end{vmatrix} = 6 + 2 + 6 + 2 - 12 + 3 = 7" },
            { "tipe": "formula_block", "latex": "D_y = \\begin{vmatrix} 1 & 6 & 1 \\\\ 2 & 3 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 2 & -1 \\end{vmatrix} = -3 + 6 + 4 + 3 - 2 + 12 = 20" },
            { "tipe": "formula_block", "latex": "D_z = \\begin{vmatrix} 1 & 1 & 6 \\\\ 2 & -1 & 3 \\\\ 1 & 2 & 2 \\end{vmatrix} = -2 + 3 + 24 + 6 - 6 - 4 = 21" },
            { "tipe": "paragraph", "text": "Hasil:" },
            { "tipe": "formula_block", "latex": "x = \\dfrac{7}{3}, \\quad y = \\dfrac{20}{3}, \\quad z = \\dfrac{21}{3} = 7" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipe": "heading",
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Kapan Pakai Metode Apa?"
        },
        {
          "tipe": "list",
          "ordered": false,
          "items": [
            "<b>Substitusi/eliminasi</b> — untuk SPL sederhana (2-3 variabel)",
            "<b>Invers matriks</b> — kalau perlu bentuk $X = A^{-1}B$",
            "<b>Aturan Cramer</b> — elegan untuk SPL 2-3 variabel, mudah dihafal",
            "<b>Gauss-Jordan</b> — untuk SPL besar atau sistem dengan banyak variabel"
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipe": "heading",
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Jenis Solusi SPL"
        },
        {
          "tipe": "list",
          "ordered": false,
          "items": [
            "$\\det(A) \\neq 0$ → solusi <b>tunggal</b>",
            "$\\det(A) = 0$ dan konsisten → solusi <b>tak hingga</b>",
            "$\\det(A) = 0$ dan tidak konsisten → <b>tidak ada solusi</b>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipe": "heading",
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Rangkuman"
        },
        {
          "tipe": "list",
          "ordered": false,
          "items": [
            "SPL dapat ditulis dalam bentuk $AX = B$",
            "Solusi: $X = A^{-1}B$",
            "Aturan Cramer: $x = D_x / D$, dst.",
            "Determinan menentukan jumlah solusi"
          ]
        }
      ]
